ection":"tome-orcs/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua","source":"On hitting with a mindstar, deal physical damage equal to your steampower in radius 1 around the target.","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"用灵晶命中时，在半径1范围内造成等于蒸汽强度的物理伤害。","target_preimage_sha256":"8d8d0a5bfe8eb673033279e964a8dac8f72042d5b490b617a5db4711f609f43b","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca/manifest.json","observation_identity":"b4e013782ff7838c6cb933d5dd9173743615e7258d313291f65d7c1d8de9fbc5","publication_commit":"f28b3813be2bf38c9fb144ceaa364a412a00da78","result_sha256":"affc0165bea8ca38cf644605e7395230e5b64405896e5d8f62fd2cd5cd91a1bb","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca/results.jsonl"}},{"call_locator":"7134ee0a17d4063d23649b590dab7b5e093ce7b0b46b513173675000b17cf64f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"eeb407009ecda5df0f293de30296c76f997715d017784e8f544d11c26c77e713","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"6765dc71128b4c044f1ffb589f64c2c3c2f17dafa366f37d1dc712b6b1e39940","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","proposed_successor_input":{"call_locator":"7134ee0a17d4063d23649b590dab7b5e093ce7b0b46b513173675000b17cf64f","component":"orcs","fixed_source_identity":"snapshot:c49975dd444a5402e37267005027ab2c54e23745a37836d31fd27fd808ee7484","logical_entry_identity":"6765dc71128b4c044f1ffb589f64c2c3c2f17dafa366f37d1dc712b6b1e39940","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","parent_entry_revision_identity":"eeb407009ecda5df0f293de30296c76f997715d017784e8f544d11c26c77e713","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/lore/krimbul.lua","source":"no no no no no no no no no no no no no\n\nI can feel it running out...  the voice spoke to me again, said \"Warning, low energy, less than ten pulses remaining,\" and the energy that once flowed so beautifully through this artifact is beginning to grow cold.  No matter how much I beg and plead down in the lake, the unicorns will not come to me directly, will not tell me why I've angered them or what I could do for them to keep my power...  was this power ever mine in the first place...?\n\n...  All right.  So, five to ten more uses...  I need to think about how this is going to work.  I've gone way too far to simply back out and act like everything should go back to normal - hee hee, can you imagine...  what do i do what do i do i can't keep stalling the conquest i can't come clean i can't win against the steam giants i can't i can't\n\nsomeone just told me the giants attacked the orcs, the orcs won\n\nI...  yes.  I've got a way out.  The Orcs must be weakened, wounded, easily dealt with or at least intimidated.  My people march on Kruk Pride, I arrange a meeting with the Giants and tell them the favor I did them, give them back the artifact if I can get it out of my horn without blowing my hand off...  they'll shelter me.  they'll give my people a plot of land.  they'll...  they'll do something that gives me some chance of not getting trampled by an angry mob...\n\ni'm sorry karbatha","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage_sha256":"ff91018247997e94e4f02ff3bf5a1efaa089539421314e2d4805525d179aadd7","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a"},"rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","section":"tome-orcs/data/lore/krimbul.lua","source":"no no no no no no no no no no no no no\n\nI can feel it running out...  the voice spoke to me again, said \"Warning, low energy, less than ten pulses remaining,\" and the energy that once flowed so beautifully through this artifact is beginning to grow cold.  No matter how much I beg and plead down in the lake, the unicorns will not come to me directly, will not tell me why I've angered them or what I could do for them to keep my power...  was this power ever mine in the first place...?\n\n...  All right.  So, five to ten more uses...  I need to think about how this is going to work.  I've gone way too far to simply back out and act like everything should go back to normal - hee hee, can you imagine...  what do i do what do i do i can't keep stalling the conquest i can't come clean i can't win against the steam giants i can't i can't\n\nsomeone just told me the giants attacked the orcs, the orcs won\n\nI...  yes.  I've got a way out.  The Orcs must be weakened, wounded, easily dealt with or at least intimidated.  My people march on Kruk Pride, I arrange a meeting with the Giants and tell them the favor I did them, give them back the artifact if I can get it out of my horn without blowing my hand off...  they'll shelter me.  they'll give my people a plot of land.  they'll...  they'll do something that gives me some chance of not getting trampled by an angry mob...\n\ni'm sorry karbatha","source_tag":"_t","target_preimage":"不，不不，不不不不，不不不不，不！\n\n我能感受到，它的力量正在流失……有一个声音在我的耳边低鸣，它说“警告，能量不足，剩余脉冲发射次数：十次以下”。曾经在这个神器周围流动的，如此美丽的能量，现在却变得暗淡冰冷。不管我多少次在湖中祈祷，恳求，独角兽都没有出现到我的身边，也没有告诉我，为什么我激怒了他们，为什么我失去了我的力量……难道，这份力量，本来就是我不应该拥有的…吗……？\n\n……好吧。也就是说，最多还能使用五到十次……我必须搞清楚，这东西到底是怎么工作的。既然走到了这一步，我已经没法回头了，我既不能再拖延征服大业，也无法坦白，难道我能停下来，假装什么也没有发生？——哈哈，怎么可能……我该怎么办，我该怎么办，我不能继续拖延征服大业，我没法脱身了，我们赢不了蒸汽巨人的，我做不到，我做不到！\n\n有人告诉我蒸汽巨人进攻了兽人…兽人，胜利了？\n\n我…好。我知道了！必须削弱那些兽人，重创他们，至少要威吓他们。让我们的族人进攻克鲁克部族，我会安排和蒸汽巨人的会面，告诉他们，我们帮了他大忙，然后交还给他们这件神器，如果我还能够把这个东西从角上拆下来而不把我的手炸掉的话……他们肯定会给我提供庇护的！然后还会给我的族人一片生存的土地。他们还会…他们至少会给我一个，让我不被那些因被欺骗而愤怒的暴民撕碎的机会的…\n\n对不起，卡巴萨…","target_preimage_sha256":"ff91018247997e94e4f02ff3bf5a1efaa089539421314e2d4805525d179aadd7","terminology_snapshot_sha256":"d4b72174d314b06054f85291c2c85c383e1124f108b35cf3d0993a6648719f6a","winner_evidence":{"adjudications_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca/adjudications.jsonl","batch_id":"batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"manifest_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca/manifest.json","observation_identity":"0f8fe0932d1ef50d6a03d45eda61aecab79442974bc7c133d75dc7e20d3fc016","publication_commit":"f28b3813be2bf38c9fb144ceaa364a412a00da78","result_sha256":"1c07bb89fb745e45c4a77b185e70a1178a1bf3212cadc0016d1abb8e5463f4af","results_path":"evidence/production-review-v2-lite/batches/batch-afcff7cb54b3816378ca/results.jsonl"}}],"items_sha256":"7c7694e5d838790d00abfd2cc9157acdbd0748c8a9194e078ba0e5d5d4fb71aa","kind":"production_review_v2_lite_repair_workset_v1","policy_sha256":"99dd4164ae278c74dd670ae726f8fea2f9c8e6ae7e44a9b9d9dd2f0753272b0a","recorded_at":"2026-09-27T14:57:47Z","recorded_by":"WP2L-5 EXECUTOR","schema_version":1}